            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "It's A New Day"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A perfectly fine ordinary peanut butter cookie. I cut back on the recipe to 20 servings since I'm not feeding a camp full of kids and it did make 20 large cookies. I didn't change the recipe at all other than the quantity and using chunky peanut butter. They are tasty and I'm sure if feeding a camp full of kids, this recipe will be fantastic."
